2
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:50,210
Don't Hug Me I'm Scared 3 is a horror, fantasy,
animation film directed by Becky Sloan.

3
00:01:06,315 --> 00:01:12,315
During a chicken picnic, Yellow Guy gets upset
after Green Bird kills a butterfly.

4
00:01:28,421 --> 00:01:34,421
Yellow Guy then meets a butterfly that takes him on a
journey to discover his concept of love.

5
00:01:50,526 --> 00:01:56,526
Yellow Guy / Duck Guy / Additional Characters (voice), played by Baker Terry.

6
